OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance tributes paid to
OL,4,Afallen across West
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across the West have come
OL,7,Ftogether to mark Remembrance Sunday.
OL,9,FIn the lead-up to the weekend, people
OL,10,Fshared memories of those who served,
OL,11,Fhighlighted relatives whose lives were
OL,12,Fshaped by war and held fundraisers to
OL,13,Fsupport veterans.
OL,15,FPeter Caddick-Adams, a historian and
OL,16,Facademic who specialises in military
OL,17,Fhistory, was asked by Radio Bristol
OL,18,Fearlier why Remembrance still played
OL,19,Fsuch an important part in national
OL,20,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
