OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance tributes paid to
OL,4,Afallen across West
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "We understand the big history
OL,7,Fof war through examining the sacrifice
OL,8,Fof individual people and through our
OL,9,Fown ancestors."
